## Devotional Content Notice

This software is a personal devotional tool rooted in the traditions of the
Shri Radhavallabh Sampraday, established by Shri Hit Harivansh Mahaprabhu Ji.

All religious texts, mantras, section names, and devotional content referenced
within this application are sacred to the Radhavallabh tradition. Users are
respectfully requested to treat this content with appropriate reverence.

This is NOT an app for commercial distribution. It is a personal sadhana
(spiritual practice) tracker built for the developer's own devotional use.

जय जय श्री हित हरिवंश 🙏
